      "title": "extcap: fix flags detection",
      "message": "extcap: fix flags detection\n\nWe should create an OUT when we have something to tell the extcap\n(when there is a toolbar or when we want to kill it), and an IN when\nwe want to listen what the extcap has to say (toolbar).\n\nIt was the opposite.\n",
